OL,3,GNEWSATeenager admits stabbing man to
OL,4,Adeath in Dundee
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager who admitted stabbing a man
OL,7,Fto death in Dundee after he made
OL,8,Fderogatory remarks about him has been
OL,9,Fdetained for six years.
OL,11,FLennon Hathway,19, killed Alistair Lamb
OL,12,Fwith a knife at his parents' home in
OL,13,Fthe Douglas area of the city in April
OL,14,F2025.
OL,16,FHathaway was due to stand trial for
OL,17,Fmurder, but prosecutors accepted his
OL,18,Fguilty plea to the lesser charge of
OL,19,Fculpable homicide.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
